:: StoryTitle
Market Day

:: StoryData
{"ifid":"D674C58C-DEFA-4F70-B7A2-27742230C0FC","format":"SugarCube","format-version":"2.36.1","start":"Home"}

:: StoryInit
<<set $coins to 3>>
<<set $mood to "calm">>
<<set $sword to false>>

:: Home [start]
You stand at home. //Cold// morning.
<<if $coins gte 5>>Plenty of coins.<<elseif $coins gt 0>>A few coins.<<else>>No coins!<</if>>
<<if $mood is "angry" or $sword>>You look dangerous.<</if>>
[[Go to market|Market]]
[[Sleep|Sleep][$mood to "rested"]]

:: Market
<<set $coins -= 1>>
<<if visited("Smith")>>The smith waves.<</if>>
<<link "Buy bread" "Bread">><<set $coins -= 2>><</link>>
[[Visit the smith->Smith]]
<<if $coins <= 0>>[[Beg->Home]]<</if>>
[[Home]]

:: Smith
<<set $sword to true>><<set $mood to "angry">>You buy a sword.
<<goto "Home">>

:: Sleep
Zzz. <<print $coins>> coins.
[[Wake->Home]]

:: Bread
Tasty. The end.
